{"id":"n73724-1-8","stage":4,"title":"작별 · 道别","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73724-1-8-1","ko":"그동안 티격태격했지만 작별을 하려니 많이 섭섭하네.","zh":"虽然我们之前总是拌嘴，但现在要分别了，真的觉得挺遗憾的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间。","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}},{"text":"티격태격했지만","meaning":"争吵，互不相让","explanation":"티격태격하다：争吵，互不相让；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"티격태격하다","audio":"/audio/d5ceb5831e486e69efec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82670","senseId":"1","lemma":"티격태격하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"티격태격했지만","audio":"/audio/7ab21f8cb3680263fbf4.mp3"}},{"text":"작별을","meaning":"道别，告别，告辞","explanation":"작별：道别，告别，告辞；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"작별","audio":"/audio/df18d2aa3dbbb39aae30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73724","senseId":"1","lemma":"작별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작별을","audio":"/audio/50b8eabf74daa90b7b56.mp3"}},{"text":"하려니","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；려니：说明正要或打算做某事时所遇到的情况、想法或困难。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하려니","audio":"/audio/a713838c93f3e8e096f9.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"섭섭하네.","meaning":"难舍，不舍","explanation":"섭섭하다：难舍，不舍；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"섭섭하다","audio":"/audio/d58a3f57409e6c7f7562.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49056","senseId":"1","lemma":"섭섭하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"섭섭하네","audio":"/audio/d38734b184493ac39587.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"d5ceb5831e486e69","term":"티격태격하다","zh":"争吵，互不相让","audio":"/audio/d5ceb5831e486e69efec.mp3","entryId":"82670","definition":"相互不合而争论对错。","pronunciation":["티격태겨카다"]},{"id":"df18d2aa3dbbb39a","term":"작별","zh":"道别，告别，告辞","audio":"/audio/df18d2aa3dbbb39aae30.mp3","entryId":"73724","definition":"相互问候后分开。","pronunciation":["작뼐"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"d58a3f57409e6c7f","term":"섭섭하다","zh":"难舍，不舍","audio":"/audio/d58a3f57409e6c7f7562.mp3","entryId":"49056","definition":"舍不得，很惋惜。","pronunciation":["섭써파다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ab9b4a1a99e320f2eec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73724-1-8-2","ko":"그래, 나중에 또 다시 만나자.","zh":"嗯，以后再见面吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"나중에","meaning":"后来，以后","explanation":"나중：后来，以后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나중","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62275","senseId":"1","lemma":"나중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나중에","audio":"/audio/a12252500035668f76c9.mp3"}},